anata ni tazuneraretara watashi

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
あなたに尋ねられたら私

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
When you come visit me

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
nikkori hohoemu deshou

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
にっこり微笑むでしょう

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
I'll probably break into a big smile

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
umaku ienai kedo subete ga

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
うまく言えないけどすべてが

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
I can't really put it into words

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
totemo totemo kageyaitemasu

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
とてもとても輝いてます

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
but everything is shining oh so bright

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
kitto ima goro minna atsumattemasu

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
きっと今頃皆集まってます

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
I bet everyone is together right about now

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
sore wa sawagashikute

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
それは騒がしくて

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
It may get a little rowdy

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
demo itoshii

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
でもいとしい

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
but I wouldn't have it any other way

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
tonde ikimasu itsumo no tokoro e

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
飛んでいきますいつもの所へ

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
Let's fly away to our usual place

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
taiyou takaku ashita mo hare desu

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
太陽高く明日も晴れです

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
Tomorrow will be clear with the sun in the sky

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
moshi mo sukoshi sabishiku nattemo

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
もしも少し寂しくなっても

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
Even if you get a little lonely

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
daijoubu chanto miteimasu

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
大丈夫ちゃんと見ています

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
it's okay, I'll be watching

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
koko de

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
ここで

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
right here

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.060
If you'll look over here, please.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:39.020
This is Vesper's new surveillance satellite, "Cyclops"

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:45.670
It orbits around the Earth, collecting various types of data around the clock.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.780
Thirty minutes ago, Cyclops intercepted certain audio information...

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.930
...and transmitted a warning to us.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:55.890
Code Yellow...

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.250
"Possible Danger" you mean?

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.760
Where is area C-1 773?

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.290
That's...

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.980
This is bad.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:13.260
At any rate, we must take some sort of measures.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:16.000
Who are you going to assign this mission to?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:28.500
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:28.500
<b>Mahoro Goes To School</b>

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.870
Yes, understood.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:28.900
Yes.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:29.950
Yes, sir.

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.910
It's all right. Please leave it to me.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:34.180
Goodbye.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.380
Mahoro, who was it?

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.720
Suguru! It's an emergency!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.940
A b-bomb?!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:51.470
Why is there a bomb at school?

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.710
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.570
To be precise, it's something that resembles a bomb.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.140
Resembles a bomb?

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:02.060
To be blunt, it's an unknown. They seem to be short of data.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.210
Then it's possible that it's not a bomb.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.250
But! However! We must be cautious!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.920
We can't deny the possibility that it may be a bomb!

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.190
If it is a bomb, how big is it...?

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:19.460
Um, at Management, explosives were divided into classes.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.850
Class Alpha bombs, used for small-scale demolition.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.410
Class Beta, capable of destroying buildings.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:31.300
And Class Daruma, which can destroy an entire city.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.110
No, I mean Class Sanma!

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.570
No, I mean... Um, uh... Class... Gamma?

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.340
I-It's okay!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.540
No matter what it is, I'll find it.

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:55.200
No way will I endanger the school you two and our friends go to.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.670
But how will you look for it?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.740
Leave it to me! I already have a plan.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.240
A plan?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.140
Yes!

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.090
Let's see... I know this is sudden, but we have a new student.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:25.830
All right, introduce yourself.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.920
Yes, ma'am! I just transferred to this class today!

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.790
My name is Mahoko Suzuki! Pleased to meet you!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.870
I've outdone myself with this perfect disguise!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:39.240
To all appearances, I'm an ordinary middle school student.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.540
It's Mahoro.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.220
It's Mahoro.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.050
It's Mahoro.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:43.660
It's Mahoro.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.820
It's Mahoro!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.640
Ms. Shikijo, give us a straight answer!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.330
What is Mahoro doing at school?

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.340
Yeah! Yeah!

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:54.770
Ms. Shikijo!

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:59.500
Damn, you're noisy! I'm the one who'd like the answer to that!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.810
Why don't you go ask her yourself?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.550
Well, it's hard to ask her while she's wearing that obvious disguise.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.140
And she seems to think she's fooling everybody, too. Right?

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:10.610
Here.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.220
What's that?

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.210
Documents?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.490
She produced the proper documents.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.360
As long as she has these, she's Mahoko Suzuki.

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:21.900
Still, I wonder why...?

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:23.470
She wouldn't!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:30.560
Why'd you ask me to come up here? Class has already started.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:35.770
I thought that you might be hungry.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.830
Hungry? I just ate lunch a little while ago.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:45.600
Suguru, your dessert is light and fluffy ME.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:50.010
I... I... I'd like some, please!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.390
Does she intend to expand their licentious lifestyle of sexual lust...

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.490
...to include this sacred institution of learning?!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.660
U-Unforgivable!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.520
Ms. Shikijo?

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.810
I have any entirely different freshness...

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:01.180
She isn't listening.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.910
...than any wrinkly, old...

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.160
Wanna go back to the classroom?

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.400
...white radish of a teacher.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.180
Sure.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.430
Damn! She's bringing filthy behavior into this school?!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.590
When it's so god-awful busy?!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.630
Oh, right. I have to mark these tests.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.000
Is there anything suspicious? Is there anything unusual?

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.750
Uh, maybe this disguise thing was a bad idea.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.800
Huh? Why do you say that?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:33.030
Dressing like this is what lets me blend in without suspicion and conduct my search!

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:42.880
Uh... That is... I think that you actually look more suspicious that way.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.470
I do?

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.110
You're saying that I still don't look like a student?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.280
Actually, it's more like it's obvious it's you.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.890
And you're not even listening...

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.690
It looks like I still need training.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.590
I understand!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:01.150
Suguru, thank you for bringing this to my attention!

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.700
In that case, I must redouble my efforts!

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:04.400
Pardon?

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:06.710
Well, please excuse me for a moment.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.720
Dash!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.200
Do you think she understood?

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:19.810
Yes. A perfect student is... Busy at study.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.350
Passionate at sports! Has a healthy appetite!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.100
Goes everywhere with her friends!

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:26.940
Nap time, nap time...

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.160
And finally, is in harmony with her fellow classmates!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.640
Oh, what fun!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.800
Yes! This is the perfect middle school student!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:38.120
No one will ever suspect me now!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:39.520
Um...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.700
Yes, Minawa?

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.350
What about the search? School is already over for the day.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.970
I was sloppy. I can't believe I did that.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:58.980
You don't have to be in such a rush. We'll help you look.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:02.440
What? No! It might be dangerous.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.750
This is our school.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.980
Besides, I can't let you face the danger all alone.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:09.830
Me, neither.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.870
Suguru... Minawa...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.480
Hey! Over here, over here!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.380
Damn it, Katsuragi, help out, too! Oops, sorry!

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.240
What's that?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.900
Oh, that. They're preparing for the school festival.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.440
It's coming up soon.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.720
They all look like they're having fun.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.400
Yeah, well, it only happens once a year.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.500
I must protect this peace.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:43.770
What's wrong?

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:44.970
This...

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:45.950
A hole?

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.320
There's another one.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:52.020
Huh? That's strange. They weren't here a while ago.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.230
Yes, sir.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:57.700
Yes... Thank you very much.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:02.080
It looks like our search target is buried beneath the surface.

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.100
Really?

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.110
And one other thing.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:10.690
These holes may mean that someone else besides us searching for it.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.970
Someone besides us? Who in the world could it be?

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.200
I don't know. We still don't know anything else.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:19.940
What are they talking about?

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.550
I think they're looking for something.

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.780
Looking for something?

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.240
Hey, wait a second.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:29.030
Are you saying she went to all the trouble of signing up here just to look for something?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.350
In other words, she's not looking for any old thing!

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.830
So, what is it?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.710
Maybe it's...

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:40.970
Do you have an idea?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.550
I might, or I might not.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.090
If you know, tell us!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:46.940
Pay up.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.540
Ten free cake coupons for "Shinjuku Sellers"!

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:56.350
We have a deal. This thing she's looking for, it's...

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.440
What's this?

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.880
A Vesper android is conducting an independent search.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.710
Not only that, the android in question is V1046-R MAHORO.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.220
What the hell is she looking for?!

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:20.340
I don't know. We haven't figured out that yet.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:25.320
If they're using a retired android, it can't be any ordinary search!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.660
It must be an extremely important strategic activity...

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.100
The type Vesper would pay attention to.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:35.100
We must formulate a contingency plan immediately! Thank you for informing me!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:41.190
I see he reacted just as you expected. Is that what you wanted?

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:47.140
I don't mind. What can he do against Mahoro?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.060
Besides, what an idiot he is.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.230
He didn't even bother to find out how you obtained that information.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:20.810
It's here.

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.470
Please stand back.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:38.920
A shoe?

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:40.960
Another false alarm?

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:44.170
What's a shoe doing buried?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.350
Maybe a dog buried it there.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.190
A dog...

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.010
Don't look my way!

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:57.270
In the first place, how come I have to play bloodhound?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.850
Is there anywhere else to look?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.620
We searched them all!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.900
According to my scan, this is the last location on school grounds.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.110
I guess this means we're out of options.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.100
Did somebody else get to it ahead of us?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:18.480
No. Whoever it is, they probably haven't found it yet, either.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.970
After all, there are even more holes now that aren't ours.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.530
Don't you think that our objective isn't underground?

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.100
Okay, step right up!

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.680
Damn it, and to think that everyone else is having fun...

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
<b></b>Super

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
<b><i></i></b>Ring Toss

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
<b><i></i></b>Ring Toss

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
<b><b>Looking for</b></b>

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
<b>Challengers</b>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.520
<b>H
a
u
n
t
e
d

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.440
<b>Puppet Theater</b>

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.440
<b>Heidi of the Alps</b>

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.430
Seriously?!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:41.100
Because it's already time for the school festival.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.990
Yeah... It doesn't really feel real for me, though.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.850
That's because we've been digging holes day in, day out.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.220
We have no choice. We've got to think of a different search method.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.350
Let's go.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:00.680
Minawa?

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.420
That hole isn't one of ours.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.220
There's still something in this one.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:11.970
Step aside.

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:14.650
Looks like we overlooked something.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.610
We didn't check the holes that were already there.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:22.350
They didn't dig down far enough!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.330
That's...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:39.320
Yes.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.580
Yes, sir. I understand.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.930
They say the professional investigation team will come soon.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.400
That's one less thing we have to worry about.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:51.020
Thank goodness, I'm finally off of hole-digging duty.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.960
All we have to do now is make sure no one gets near this thing.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.530
I won't let you do that!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:58.850
Who's there?

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:05.160
MNA-564... A Management cyborg!

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:17.580
I have a lock on that boy. Hand over the weapon.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.030
Weapon?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.650
Be quick about it!

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:21.950
Mahoko!

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.770
I have no choice.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.430
Good. Now stay put.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:40.250
Huh? Did I just step in something?

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.060
That voice...

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.200
Miyuki?

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.270
No, you are mistaken!

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.070
No more monkey business! I'm taking this!

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:50.900
Farewell!

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:55.330
This totem grants all your love wishes, and it's all mine!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:55.980
Pardon?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.010
It's one of the seven school legends.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:03.050
If you find it and make a wish, it'll make anyone you want fall in love with you.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:07.450
Maybe those two are looking for it to deepen their own relationship.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.260
I'll never let that happen!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.040
Farewell!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:13.310
Hold it right there!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.260
I will not allow you get the drop on me!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.740
If I only had that totem, my relationship with Suguru would progr... Eek!

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:31.280
No, it will be mine! Even I want to feel love one of these days!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:36.300
I will capture it so I may know a love that burns bright!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.050
There's one over here, too.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:41.500
Those voices...

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.140
Rin, Kawahara, and Hamaji?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:45.650
Who is Rin?

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:47.130
Ha! You are mistaken!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.940
You're imagining things!

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.020
It's mine, all mine!

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.040
You won't get away!

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.790
W-Why is it turning out like this?

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.070
We have to follow them!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.060
Right!

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.180
What the heck was all that about just now?

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.010
Why, you...

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.480
Hold on there!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:11.090
I'm the one you're going to fight!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.020
Huh? What's going on over there?

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:21.910
Everyone, you have the wrong idea! That's not a love totem!

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:26.040
Ha! First, I suck the drink the blood of a living man!

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.330
Call me Sister!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.700
Hold it!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:35.030
If you handle it that roughly, the shock will make it ex--

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.340
Oh, where the heck is it?

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.480
I have it!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.470
Now, Suguru and I will--

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.390
Stop!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:54.980
That's--!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.330
T-They're too fast!

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.400
Not even I can catch up.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.970
When their mind is set, the power of a human can be terrifying!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:10.540
The more you hold it in, the worse it is when it finally surfaces.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.650
Chizu!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.450
S-Stop Rin!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.470
You want me to stop her?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.600
P-Please!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.080
Hold it right there! Yeah, you with the cow udders!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:28.800
Who just shouted out my sore spot?!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.050
This match goes to me.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.950
It's not over yet!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:48.160
Interesting.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.660
That's--!

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.620
Step aside, please!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.930
Caught it!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.390
Mahoko!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.190
Got it!

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:19.490
Ms. Shikijo! Give it back! It's dangerous!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.920
Give it back?!

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.850
Ten years ago, I--

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.730
No! Don't look!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.820
Nooo!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:34.980
What's this?

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.090
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:35.210
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:35.380
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:35.590
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:35.710
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:35.840
<b>My Poems</b>

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.810
How wonderful I am to be in love with you.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.770
To my prince whom I, Saori, have not yet seen.

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:46.150
When I think of you, my heart weeps.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:51.060
Senior Makoto, please use this undeserving Saori as your pillow at night.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.760
Stop it!

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:56.310
That capsule... Could it be a--

00:18:57.020 --> 00:19:00.660
It's a time capsule I buried when I was a student here!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.900
You mean it's not a love totem?

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:07.630
Legends are just legends, I guess.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.100
Crud...

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.100
Crud...

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:13.800
But why dig up a time capsule from ten years ago? Why now?

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:19.340
Because it would be embarrassing if it were dug up during next year's school renovations!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:23.020
I wanted to dig it up and get rid of it before that could happen!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.290
So you're saying that the holes all over the school grounds were...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:32.560
I dug them! Right now, this stuff is like a bomb to me!

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:38.160
The voiceprint on the collected data is a perfect match to that of Saori Shikijo.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.380
Which means...

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.680
That would mean...

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.090
Yes, sir...

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.200
The data collection and analysis system...

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.890
I'll get to work on modifications right away.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.480
Yes, see that you do.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:03.910
I'm sorry that our slip-up got all of you involved.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:09.090
Still, I'm glad that the school was never in any danger.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.000
Really. I hope this peace continues forever.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.050
Um, big sister?

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:24.050
Please don't worry, Minawa. It's all right now. Huh?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.360
Uh... It all looked so delicious, I couldn't help myself.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:31.920
I'm sorry!

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.710
Mahoro, let's go, too!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:36.510
Pardon?

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:37.970
The school festival.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:41.720
Your mission is over, right? So let's go enjoy ourselves.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:43.820
Sure!

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.310
Oh, here they are!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.200
So, this is where you went!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:49.680
Everyone.

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.630
Oh, that looks good!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:52.990
Would you like some?

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.970
Would you all like to look around the festival with us?

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.100
Yeah, let's go! Let's go!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:03.270
By the way, Mahoro, why did you come to school, anyway?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:07.550
Wha--?! No, no! My name isn't Mahoro!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.390
Oh, come on. Are you still saying that?

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:12.080
What on earth could you possibly mean?

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.670
We see right through you!

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.060
Y-You have the wrong person!

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:17.730
Sure, whatever. Well, why don't we let her pretend for now?

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:21.820
My name has been Mahoko Suzuki since the day I left my mother's womb!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:30.510
